Dialogue: 2,0:01:07.56,0:16:11.70,Topic Banner,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(340,57)\fad(450,230)}Looking Back on These 5 Years
Dialogue: 2,0:16:11.70,0:22:33.12,Topic Banner,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(340,57)\fad(230,0)}Messages to Everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.18,Leo/need - 1Line,Leo/need,0,0,0,,Good Need-vening!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.23,0:00:11.68,Ichika - Top,Ichika,0,0,0,,This is Ruriko Noguchi, voice of Ichika Hoshino.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.68,0:00:16.13,Saki - Top,Saki,0,0,0,,This is Karin Isobe, voice of Saki Tenma.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.95,0:00:22.72,Honami - Top,Honami,0,0,0,,This is Reina Ueda, voice of Honami Mochizuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.88,0:00:29.92,Shiho - Top,Shiho,0,0,0,,This is Yuki Nakashima, voice of Shiho Hinomori.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.39,0:00:34.12,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,To celebrate Project SEKAI's 5th Anniversary,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.12,0:00:37.01,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,the four of us who voice Leo/need
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.01,0:00:38.89,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,are here with a special video message for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.89,0:00:40.58,Saki - 1Line,Saki,0,0,0,,It's finally happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.68,0:00:47.37,Saki - 1Line,Saki,0,0,0,,A world where we can actually touch each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.19,0:00:56.30,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,This is actually the first time all four of us have appeared together!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.35,0:00:59.10,Saki,Saki,0,0,0,,Wait, the first time?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.15,0:01:00.83,Ichika - 1Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,That's the 5th Anniversary for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.72,0:01:05.38,Saki,Saki,0,0,0,,The four of us are really all here together!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.42,0:01:07.51,Leo/need - 1Line,Leo/need,0,0,0,,We're so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.71,0:01:14.11,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,Now it's time for us to look back on these past five years.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.75,0:01:17.02,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,Does anyone have something they really want to bring up?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.30,0:01:21.70,Shiho,Shiho,0,0,0,,Are we all like your students?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.70,0:01:24.02,Shiho,Shiho,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}I'm too nervous to go first!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.06,0:01:27.43,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,Since I brought it up, I'll start with Ichika.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.41,0:01:34.10,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,At first, I remember thinking Ichika had a lot of "..." lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.10,0:01:37.65,Ichika - 1Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,She had a lot of monologues, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.65,0:01:40.37,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,like there were things she wanted to say to everyone, but couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.37,0:01:43.09,Ichika - 1Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,She had so much inner conflict,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.09,0:01:45.11,Ichika - 1Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,always bottling things up inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.11,0:01:48.03,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,and I was often directed to hold her voice back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.76,0:01:50.78,Ichika - 1Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,But five years later,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.38,0:01:54.07,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,she really lets loose when the moment calls for it,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.07,0:01:56.76,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,and she can say what's on her mind to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.76,0:01:59.44,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,Like her passionate feelings for yakisoba bread...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.94,0:02:02.63,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,She'll talk about it at full throttle!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.61,0:02:06.43,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,She didn't really seem like that type at first,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.43,0:02:10.27,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,but lately she's come right out of her shell—like with her love for Miku-san—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.55,0:02:15.39,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,and I feel like she can talk to everyone without hiding herself at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.39,0:02:17.41,Ichika - 1Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,That makes me so happy,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.41,0:02:19.36,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,and realizing what an adorable girl Ichika is
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.36,0:02:21.46,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,all over again after five years
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.46,0:02:24.78,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,makes voicing her so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.25,0:02:28.75,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,Her singing feels really different from the beginning too, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.75,0:02:30.11,Ichika - 1Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,It really does!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.11,0:02:33.49,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,At first, to fit Ichika's character,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.49,0:02:38.08,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,I held back from letting her emotions burst right out,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.92,0:02:44.50,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,so I sang in a pretty restrained, composed way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.50,0:02:48.82,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,But as the story progressed and Ichika herself grew—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.82,0:02:52.71,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,honing her skills through street performances and all—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.71,0:02:57.67,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,they told me, "Feel free to pour more and more emotion into your singing."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.67,0:03:06.04,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,So lately, I've been singing freely and having fun without holding back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.61,0:03:08.56,Saki - 1Line,Saki,0,0,0,,As for Saki,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.56,0:03:11.81,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,I don't think anyone would guess this, but
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.55,0:03:20.07,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,back during our first voice sessions, before the game was even out,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.07,0:03:23.88,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,we had a song recording pretty early on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.55,0:03:34.09,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,Back then, compared to how Saki-chan is now,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.09,0:03:40.18,Saki - 1Line,Saki,0,0,0,,she was probably a bit more mature...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.09,0:03:46.05,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,Unlike the big "Yay!" energy she has today,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.05,0:03:52.80,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,they initially asked for a different kind of Saki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.80,0:03:58.18,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,So in our very first song, she sounds just a little
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.18,0:04:00.65,Saki - 1Line,Saki,0,0,0,,more composed than she does now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.65,0:04:03.93,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it, maybe she does!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.38,0:04:10.47,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,Personally, though—just from my own impression—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.47,0:04:13.24,Saki - 2Line,,0,0,0,,in the beginning, I felt Saki-chan was...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.24,0:04:18.33,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,seeing both her design and the story,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.20,0:04:23.79,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,she came across as super bright and cheerful to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.04,0:04:28.22,Saki - 1Line,Saki,0,0,0,,So during those first voice sessions,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.22,0:04:31.43,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,I pitched my own vision of Saki-chan to them,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.43,0:04:38.28,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,and we found a nice balance—that's how early Saki-chan came to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.28,0:04:42.35,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,So maybe there could've been a much cooler Saki...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.35,0:04:45.01,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,I wonder how Leo/need would've turned out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.44,0:04:48.81,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,Yeah, without Saki-chan as she is, Leo/need would've...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.85,0:04:54.63,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,Our title calls would've been way too quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.12,0:05:00.14,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,There might have been a "cool" version of Leo/need!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.14,0:05:07.90,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,Looking back, my biggest takeaway from these five years,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.90,0:05:12.30,Saki - 1Line,Saki,0,0,0,,is just how much Hona-chan has grown.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.30,0:05:15.89,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,If someone asked what stood out most over these five years,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.89,0:05:20.44,Saki - 1Line,Saki,0,0,0,,it'd be just how far Honami has come,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.44,0:05:24.46,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,both her shift in mindset and her newfound resolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.46,0:05:25.88,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,Seeing her growth has been amazing,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.88,0:05:28.22,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,so I'd love to hear your thoughts on that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.22,0:05:28.73,Honami - 1Line,Honami,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.73,0:05:29.55,Honami - 1Line,Honami,0,0,0,,Definitely,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.55,0:05:31.47,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,she's really come such a long way,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.47,0:05:33.56,Honami - 1Line,Honami,0,0,0,,and grown so much,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.56,0:05:37.43,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,and while I'm sure she still has plenty of growing left to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.43,0:05:39.58,Honami - 2Line,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.58,0:05:45.30,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,She's so kind, she's always extra considerate of others.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.30,0:05:52.27,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,but because of that, her classmates were always asking her,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.27,0:05:56.01,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,"sure, you're nice, but aren't you nice to everyone?"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.01,0:06:02.13,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,and that past left her with some trauma.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.13,0:06:06.49,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,With that weighing on her, sharing her own feelings with others
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.49,0:06:08.56,Honami - 1Line,Honami,0,0,0,,became really difficult for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.56,0:06:12.41,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,She'd worry, "If I speak up again, will people criticize me?"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.41,0:06:15.55,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,or "Will I make someone feel bad?"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.08,0:06:23.00,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,She prioritized everyone else so much that she lost confidence in herself,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.00,0:06:26.76,Honami - 1Line,Honami,0,0,0,,so during the early voice sessions,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.76,0:06:32.16,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,I was overwhelmed by negative emotions a lot of the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.70,0:06:35.72,Shiho - 1Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,Wait, you felt that way yourself, Ueda-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.72,0:06:38.85,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah—when voicing Honami.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.22,0:06:44.99,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,Those feelings of sadness, pain, heartache, loneliness—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.99,0:06:48.55,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,I'd get pulled down by those emotions,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.55,0:06:55.24,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,and when your feelings waver, your voice naturally wavers too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.24,0:07:01.38,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,I remember my breathing sounding really faint and ragged,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.38,0:07:05.60,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,and it actually hurt just to speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.60,0:07:09.00,Honami - 1Line,Honami,0,0,0,,I'd even feel short of breath...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.00,0:07:12.57,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,My singing was like that too, at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.57,0:07:16.17,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,But once she made up with everyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.66,0:07:21.31,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,and built up confidence with each small success one by one,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.31,0:07:24.73,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,she learned what true kindness really means—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.73,0:07:26.85,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,that just keeping quiet and going along with everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.85,0:07:28.74,Honami - 1Line,Honami,0,0,0,,isn't real kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.74,0:07:31.77,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,She learned to tell herself, "I need to speak up properly."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.77,0:07:33.11,Honami - 1Line,Honami,0,0,0,,And nowadays,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.49,0:07:37.70,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,she'll say, "Mind if I take this?"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.70,0:07:41.87,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,or like, "I want to think it through properly before we all decide."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.87,0:07:45.75,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,Thinking, "I have to step up as leader and be our pillar,"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.75,0:07:49.76,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,I feel like she's grown so much stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.76,0:07:55.10,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,So even during recording sessions, I found a real steadiness come into her voice,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.55,0:08:00.89,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,and I naturally used less breath, so I stopped getting winded as easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.54,0:08:05.61,Honami - 1Line,Honami,0,0,0,,It's a strange thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.61,0:08:09.29,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,but I think it's probably thanks to Honami's growth
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.29,0:08:13.90,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,that speaking as her has become easier for me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.90,0:08:16.05,Honami - 1Line,Honami,0,0,0,,Going forward, she's going to face
Comment: 0,0:08:16.05,0:08:20.11,Honami - 2Line,NOTE,0,0,0,,[Overlay: Meme - "DOES HE KNOW?" with Event #220 'Stars Off Orbit' banner]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.05,0:08:20.11,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,more and more choices to make, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.27,0:08:23.59,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,Taking time to understand what everyone wants,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.59,0:08:26.18,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,and wanting to respect their feelings,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.18,0:08:30.17,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,what will she ultimately choose to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.17,0:08:34.15,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,I feel she'll have even bigger mountains to climb from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.49,0:08:38.31,Honami - 1Line,Honami,0,0,0,,So that's really how these past five years have felt for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.31,0:08:41.53,Shiho - 1Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,Okay, last up is Shiho!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.53,0:08:47.02,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,Shiho was really prickly at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.35,0:08:50.77,Saki - 1Line,Saki,0,0,0,,She still is, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.77,0:08:54.26,Shiho - 1Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,Nowadays, especially toward Saki,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.26,0:09:00.03,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,she's kind of settled into teasing her a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.03,0:09:06.72,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,In the beginning, she didn't really show her emotions.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.72,0:09:09.25,Shiho - 1Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,She was more intense, you could say,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.25,0:09:13.12,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,and they wanted me to really lean into that lone wolf persona.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.12,0:09:16.36,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,But they told me that deep down, she cared about everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.36,0:09:19.78,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,and was staying true to her own convictions.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.78,0:09:22.20,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,When I received that direction,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.20,0:09:26.52,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,I thought, "Ah, I see," and played her with that in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.99,0:09:30.41,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,Compared to how she is now, I feel like at first
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.41,0:09:36.57,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,she came off as really cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.25,0:09:42.60,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,Then she made up with everyone again and they've been progressing as a band.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.60,0:09:47.49,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,Things like joining classmates for the school festival,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.49,0:09:51.46,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,or doing things together—she used to keep her distance from all that,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.46,0:09:55.53,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,but now she takes part, so even with people she's meeting for the first time,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.53,0:09:59.74,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,she feels a lot more approachable now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.74,0:10:05.11,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,That's something I'm very conscious of when I'm playing her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.91,0:10:10.70,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,I feel like she's definitely softened up a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.20,0:10:15.85,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,As I've been playing her myself, I feel like I can finally
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.85,0:10:18.51,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,have more fun with the role, so to speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.62,0:10:24.33,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,Shiho actually loves cute things,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.95,0:10:29.32,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,and little moments like that pop up in stories every now and then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.32,0:10:32.62,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,Whenever they do, I get to go all-in with them,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.62,0:10:35.92,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,like, "See? She has this adorable side to her, too!"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.92,0:10:38.98,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,promoting that charm of hers a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.98,0:10:43.28,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,At the same time, keeping everyone in line
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.28,0:10:45.83,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,and her burning passion for music
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.83,0:10:50.40,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,are things I always keep close when I play her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.40,0:10:53.88,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,It feels like this is her own way of growing—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.88,0:10:59.28,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,discovering how to connect with everyone over these five years.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.28,0:11:04.15,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,I definitely feel that while voicing her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.32,0:11:09.24,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,During song recordings too, we talk things through a lot with staff, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.24,0:11:10.06,Ichika - 2Line,,0,0,0,,How is it for you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.06,0:11:13.51,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,I've always wondered how the rest of you record your parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.56,0:11:19.77,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,Most of the time, Icchan is always the first one to record.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.77,0:11:26.09,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,And like you mentioned earlier, you've gotten so good at putting all these little emotional nuances
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.09,0:11:28.99,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,into your singing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.93,0:11:33.25,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,So when we go in to record, right before we step into the booth,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.25,0:11:36.79,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,they always play us the track Icchan already recorded.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.15,0:11:43.61,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,That's when I'll think, "Oh, so this is how she sang this song,"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.51,0:11:49.91,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,or "She's going pretty intense at this part,"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.91,0:11:53.67,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,or "this is the vibe she went with here." I take careful note of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.67,0:11:58.49,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,After all, as our lead vocalist, Icchan sets the foundation—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.49,0:12:02.36,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,and so "piggybacking" isn't quite the word, but I follow her lead,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.36,0:12:05.63,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,building on her direction while also keeping in mind the story context,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.63,0:12:09.58,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,and the detailed direction the staff gives us on their vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.58,0:12:12.52,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,They always come with a brief for us in the studio,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.52,0:12:15.37,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,so I build on all of that 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.37,0:12:17.93,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,while also putting in what Saki-chan is feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.93,0:12:19.71,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,And so... thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.96,0:12:21.55,Ichika - 1Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,I'm so glad!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.55,0:12:25.13,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,I'm glad going first helps you guys with the recording so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.18,0:12:28.79,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,I'm always so amazed by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.79,0:12:32.37,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,Pretty much every time I walk in, they say, "You're first up, Noguchi-san."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.37,0:12:33.69,Ichika - 2Line,,0,0,0,,I'm always like "alright, let's do this!"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.69,0:12:36.06,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,Which makes me wonder how you pull it off
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.06,0:12:37.73,Saki - 1Line,Saki,0,0,0,,without any guide track to go off of.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.53,0:12:43.02,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,When it came to deciding how much emotion to let out,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.02,0:12:46.50,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,nowadays it's fine to bring out plenty of emotion,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.50,0:12:49.99,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,but towards the beginning, sometimes they felt "Ichika's skills aren't quite there yet..."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.99,0:12:52.93,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,That was pretty tricky.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.93,0:12:57.20,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,We'd test things out, asking, "Is pushing it this far okay?"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.20,0:13:01.34,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,or hear back, "Ah, that's a bit too weak," and keep trying again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.34,0:13:03.81,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,We went back and forth like that a lot early on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.81,0:13:07.36,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,So you did a lot of takes and discussed it a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.36,0:13:10.66,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,Even for parts where she's belting, if I pushed it too much,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.66,0:13:13.36,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,it'd be like, "Ichika probably can't express this much yet."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.36,0:13:18.85,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,There was a lot of that trial and error with Ichika.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.72,0:13:23.79,Ichika - 1Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,Now, pretty much anything goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.76,0:13:30.78,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,Moments like that really remind me of how much Ichika has grown, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.78,0:13:34.24,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,She's worked so hard as a vocalist for five years,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.24,0:13:36.32,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,I definitely feel that during recording sessions.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.47,0:13:44.46,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,What I'm curious about is, with Honami-chan's soft, gentle voice,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.46,0:13:48.23,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,some of Leo/need's songs are pretty intense, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.23,0:13:50.30,Ichika - 1Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,I imagine it must be tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.30,0:13:54.07,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,It must be difficult to maintain her character feel
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.07,0:13:59.16,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,while still pulling off the heavier rock songs. I think it's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.16,0:14:01.23,Ichika - 1Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,How is it for you?
Comment: 0,0:14:04.70,0:14:06.48,Honami - 1Line,Honami,0,0,0,,Make text smaller and semi transparent to match teleops
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.70,0:14:06.48,Honami - 1Line,Honami,0,0,0,,It really is tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.47,0:14:09.25,Honami - 1Line,Honami,0,0,0,,It really is tough, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.01,0:14:22.58,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,Of course, I use Icchan's vocals as a guide too,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.04,0:14:27.96,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,and the staff here really lets us lean into
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.96,0:14:31.04,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,each character's personality when we sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.06,0:14:35.65,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,Even on intense songs, they'll sometimes say, "Let's bring out more Honami,"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.65,0:14:39.23,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,and give me direction like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.23,0:14:43.99,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,Also, to match her growth, they might say, "For Honami as she is now,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.99,0:14:49.86,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,maybe you could mix in a bit more of your chest voice."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.86,0:14:55.87,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,So I've gradually adjusted how much power to put into her voice,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.80,0:15:01.11,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,and I adapt my vocal delivery depending on the song.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.11,0:15:09.03,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,Also, in Honami's voice, I just can't project low notes at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.03,0:15:13.99,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,Her Honami-ness comes through much better on the higher notes,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.99,0:15:16.59,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,so they'll say, "Sing the low parts leaving them to Shiho-chan,"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.59,0:15:17.77,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,or things like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.77,0:15:19.99,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,That's so true—they say that in my sessions, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.21,0:15:24.21,Shiho - 1Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,Leave them to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.80,0:15:28.80,Shiho - 1Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,And I'll leave the high notes to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.49,0:15:37.11,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,Leo/need's songs are super high, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.91,0:15:43.75,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,Sometimes the choruses are seriously outrageous.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.75,0:15:48.69,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,At times like that, depending on how the vocal parts are split,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.69,0:15:51.97,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,I still record a take in the original key, of course, but
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.97,0:15:55.63,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,sometimes I'm the only one also singing an octave lower.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.83,0:16:01.98,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,When they mix the track, they make good use of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.98,0:16:04.42,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,using it as a harmony part.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.86,0:16:11.11,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,So I just think to myself, "Ah, I'm the unsung hero!"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.64,0:16:16.50,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,To wrap things up, we'd like each of us to share a message
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.50,0:16:21.35,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,for all the ProSeka fans out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.32,0:16:25.34,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,This is Ruriko Noguchi. Once again, on our 5th Anniversary,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.34,0:16:28.51,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,congratulations, and thank you all so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.66,0:16:31.65,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,Looking back on these five years, it feels like ProSeka was always there,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.65,0:16:36.27,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,and with new voice sessions every single month
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.27,0:16:39.70,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,along with song recordings, I stayed immersed in ProSeka's world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.70,0:16:44.23,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,It truly feels like five rich, fulfilling years
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.23,0:16:45.86,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,that flew by in the blink of an eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.86,0:16:48.25,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,And it's all thanks to every one of you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.25,0:16:51.43,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,supporting ProSeka that we've reached five years.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.43,0:16:54.00,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,I don't think you often get five years
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.00,0:16:56.87,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,as rich and fulfilling as these,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.87,0:17:00.49,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,so my heart is truly overflowing with gratitude to you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.49,0:17:03.78,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,I'm sure lots of fun new things
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.78,0:17:06.10,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,are waiting ahead, so please continue
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.10,0:17:09.13,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,to enjoy everything at your own pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.13,0:17:11.17,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,Thank you all so very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.50,0:17:13.59,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,This is Karin Isobe, voice of Saki Tenma.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.69,0:17:20.60,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,Saying "ProSeka was always there" really resonated with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.48,0:17:23.15,Saki - 1Line,Saki,0,0,0,,It really was!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.03,0:17:29.94,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,There wasn't a single month where we weren't involved with ProSeka.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.54,0:17:34.44,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,Like, "Wait, we're recording this much in a single month?!"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.44,0:17:36.11,Saki - 1Line,Saki,0,0,0,,Don't you ever have months like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.35,0:17:41.27,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,It's truly been such a rich and dense time,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.27,0:17:46.74,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,and while five years is a long time, for those of us on this wild ride,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.74,0:17:49.96,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,I think it's really flown by in a flash.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.96,0:17:52.53,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,But when we get a chance to look back like we are today,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.53,0:17:55.11,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,you realize just how many things have happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.71,0:17:59.55,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,Even thinking about Saki-chan, seeing how much things have changed
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.55,0:18:02.87,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,really hits me all over again when I stop to reflect.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.87,0:18:05.52,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,And watching the rest of Leo/need around me,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.52,0:18:12.06,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,everything you feel while acting comes across so vividly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.73,0:18:17.25,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,I really had been taking in
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.25,0:18:19.77,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,all of those changes through Saki-chan's eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.77,0:18:23.19,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,Today felt like confirming we were all on the same wavelength—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.19,0:18:28.86,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,it reassured me that what came through from you all wasn't mistaken,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.20,0:18:34.89,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,and I hope the things I can deliver to everyone as Saki-chan
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.89,0:18:38.57,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,will keep growing more and more from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.57,0:18:42.59,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,I mean, we're still recording all sorts of things!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.89,0:18:46.31,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,So please look forward to seeing
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.31,0:18:47.92,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,what's next for Leo/need!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.92,0:18:49.25,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for today!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.25,0:18:51.22,Saki - 2Line,Saki,0,0,0,,And we look forward to your continued support!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.30,0:18:55.64,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,This is Reina Ueda, voice of Honami Mochizuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.88,0:19:05.43,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,During voice sessions, there are scenes where I interact
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.43,0:19:09.37,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,with characters outside of Leo/need, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.37,0:19:14.18,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,and while each of those scenes has its own character dynamics
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.18,0:19:20.10,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,that are of course very precious in their own right,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.10,0:19:23.02,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,whenever I record a scene with just the four of us
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.02,0:19:24.95,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,in Leo/need talking together,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.95,0:19:29.62,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,that's when I feel "Ah, I'm home" the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.93,0:19:34.60,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,Over these five years, this group called Leo/need
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.60,0:19:38.33,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,truly became a home for both Honami and me—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.93,0:19:42.70,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,a place where we belong and can always return to,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.70,0:19:46.61,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,and I'm reminded of that in every voice session.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.61,0:19:49.79,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,During song recordings, too, I'll think,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.79,0:19:51.76,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,"This part would be perfect for Saki-chan,"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.76,0:19:55.18,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,or, "Icchan sounded so cool on this part,"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.18,0:19:58.00,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,or, "We can leave this part to Shiho-chan!"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.00,0:20:04.14,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,My trust in my truly reliable bandmates
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.14,0:20:11.30,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,has grown so, so much, and I can really feel that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.30,0:20:19.59,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,Right now, Ichika is rediscovering
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.59,0:20:24.28,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,the joy of making Vocaloid songs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.28,0:20:30.52,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,Saki-chan is cherishing the joy of having fun up close with everyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.52,0:20:34.42,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,and Shiho-chan's desire to play a live show at a big venue
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.42,0:20:37.48,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,has been growing stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.48,0:20:44.88,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,With everyone's passions running so high, Honami, as the leader,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.88,0:20:48.70,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,reaffirmed that she had to make a choice in an episode
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.70,0:20:51.72,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,that I'm sure you've all played.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.72,0:20:55.89,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,As for what will truly happen with Leo/need from here on out,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.89,0:21:00.31,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,I hope you'll all continue to watch over us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.31,0:21:02.77,Honami - 2Line,Honami,0,0,0,,We look forward to your continued support!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.20,0:21:06.27,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,This is Yuki Nakashima, voice of Shiho Hinomori.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.27,0:21:09.94,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,These past five years have really flown by.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.66,0:21:13.34,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,It feels like the game was just released the other day,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.34,0:21:17.77,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,that's just how jam-packed these five years have been.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.77,0:21:20.72,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,Looking back on it with everyone today,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.72,0:21:24.51,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,I was able to feel that all over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.06,0:21:28.11,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,And the fact that so many people are playing the game
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.11,0:21:31.16,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,is something I really feel during livestreams and real-life events,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.01,0:21:35.95,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,and when I see everyone getting excited on social media.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.95,0:21:39.84,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,So that we can continue to deliver even better things to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.50,0:21:43.39,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,I want to do my best as a cast member.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.39,0:21:47.18,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,Seeing how passionately everyone across the cast
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.18,0:21:49.51,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,pours their hearts into thinking about
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.51,0:21:51.47,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,how to make ProSeka even more exciting—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.87,0:21:55.22,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,when I read the stories or listen to the songs,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.22,0:21:57.41,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,I'm blown away like, "Wow, everyone's doing such amazing work!"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.41,0:22:00.14,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,Taking all of that inspiration in—
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.19,0:22:05.91,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,since we hear the finished songs right when they're released, too—
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.91,0:22:07.20,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,so we don't lose out to everyone else,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.20,0:22:09.83,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,we want to keep giving it our all as Leo/need, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.83,0:22:11.40,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for these five years!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.40,0:22:13.79,Shiho - 2Line,Shiho,0,0,0,,And we look forward to your continued support!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.81,0:22:18.21,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,Well, time really flew by, didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.21,0:22:20.95,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,Sadly, that's all the time we have for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.95,0:22:23.72,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,Once again, please continue to support Project SEKAI
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.72,0:22:27.45,Ichika - 2Line,Ichika,0,0,0,,and Leo/need from here on out!
